# {{senseid|pt|the ability to control}} {{l|en|power}} {{gloss|the ability to coerce, influence or control}}
#: {{ux|pt|O rei do Reino Unido tem pouco '''poder'''.|The king of the United Kingdom has little '''power'''.}}
# {{senseid|pt|powerful organisation}} {{lb|pt|chiefly|geopolitics}} {{l|en|power}} {{gloss|a powerful organisation, especially a country}}
#: {{ux|pt|Os '''poderes''' mundiais se reuniram.|The world '''powers''' got together.}}
# {{senseid|pt|possession}} {{l|en|possession}}; {{only used in|[[em poder de]]|lang=pt}}
# {{senseid|pt|branch of the government}} {{lb|pt|politics}} {{l|en|power}} {{gloss|branch of the government}}
#: {{ux|pt|Quem lida com isso é o '''poder''' judiciário.|The '''branch''' that deals with this is the judiciary.}}
# {{senseid|pt|extraordinary quality}} {{l|en|power}} {{gloss|extraordinary quality}}
#: {{ux|pt|Essa vacina tem o '''poder''' da cura.|This vaccine has the '''power''' of cure.}}
# {{senseid|pt|superpower}} {{lb|pt|science fiction}} {{l|en|power}}; {{l|en|superpower}} {{gloss|supernatural ability}}
